#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install Qiskit Runtime {#install-qiskit-runtime}"
msgstr "Qiskit Runtime installieren {#install-qiskit-runtime}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to install Qiskit Runtime:\n"
msgstr "Folge diesen Schritten, um Qiskit Runtime zu installieren:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Clone the Qiskit Runtime repository.\n"
msgstr "Klone das Qiskit Runtime Repository.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Change to the `qiskit-ibm-runtime` directory.\n"
msgstr "Wechsle in das Verzeichnis `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install `qiskit-runtime`. We recommend using a [virtual "
"environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) to avoid polluting"
" your global Python installation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Installiere `qiskit-runtime`. Wir empfehlen die Verwendung einer [virtuellen"
" Umgebung](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html), um deine globale "
"Python-Installation nicht zu beeinträchtigen.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Standard install**:\n"
msgstr "**Standardinstallation**:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install .\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Editable mode**: In this mode, you don't need to reinstall Qiskit when "
"there are code changes to the project.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Bearbeitbarer Modus**: In diesem Modus musst du Qiskit nicht neu "
"installieren, wenn sich der Code des Projekts ändert.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install -e .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install -e .\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    In editable mode, the compiled extensions are built in _debug mode_ "
"without optimizations.\n"
msgstr ""
"    Im bearbeitbaren Modus werden die kompilierten Erweiterungen im _Debug-"
"Modus_ ohne Optimierungen erstellt.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(Optional) If you want to run tests or linting checks, install the developer"
" requirements. We recommend using a [virtual "
"environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) to avoid polluting"
" your global Python installation.\n"
msgstr ""
"(Optional) Wenn du Tests oder Linting-Prüfungen ausführen möchtest, "
"installiere die Entwickleranforderungen. Wir empfehlen die Verwendung einer "
"[virtuellen Umgebung](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html), um deine"
" globale Python-Installation nicht zu beeinträchtigen.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Nächste Schritte {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - Read the [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) to contribute to `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"  - [Install the Qiskit SDK from source](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Run your first program](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Try a tutorial, such as [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Empfehlungen\">\n"
"  - Lies die [Beitragsrichtlinien](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md), um zu `qiskit-ibm-runtime` beizutragen.\n"
"  - [Qiskit SDK aus dem Quellcode installieren](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Dein erstes Programm ausführen](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Probiere ein Tutorial aus, zum Beispiel [Grovers Algorithmus](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
